    "@es": "Una sugerencia",
    "@en": "A suggestion"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**怎么了** es una expresión fija para preguntar «¿qué pasa?» o «¿qué te ocurre?». **药** significa medicamento y **医院**, hospital.",
     "@en": "**怎么了** is a fixed expression to ask «What is it?» or «What's the matter with you?». **药** means medicine and **医院**, hospital."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Para sugerir algo puedes terminar con **吧**: **我们去医院吧** («vamos al hospital»).",
     "@en": "To suggest something you can end up with **吧**: **我们去医院吧** («Let's go to the hospital.»)."
    }
   ]
